---

<BaseLayout
  title="Headquarters Dojo"
  description="Learn about Seishinkai Headquarters (Seishinkan Okubo Dojo), one of Hokkaido's largest permanent karate facilities located in Shiroishi Ward, Sapporo."
  lang="en"
  path="/en/dojo/hq/"
>
  <section class="dojo-list">
    <div class="page-container">

      <div class="section__title-area">
        <span class="section-label">HEADQUARTERS</span>
        <h1 class="section-title">Seishinkan Okubo Headquarters Dojo</h1>
      </div>
      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">Located on Tohoku-dori Avenue, on the border between Shiroishi and Toyohira Wards in Sapporo</h2>
      <p class="detail-page__lead">
        Our headquarters dojo has operated as a permanent training facility since March 1986.<br />
        Continuing the tradition established during the former Sapporo Branch era, it is one of Sapporo's longest-established karate dojos, with nearly half a century of history.<br />
        The dojo moved to its current location in 2012 and now features dedicated parking and approximately 660㎡ (about 7,100 sq ft) of training space across the main and annex buildings, making it one of the largest permanent karate facilities in Hokkaido.<br />
        Students range in age from 3 to 84 years old and enjoy training together in a friendly atmosphere.<br />
        Classes include Junior Classes (Mon/Wed), Adult Classes (Wed/Sat), Kindergarten & Elementary Classes (Thu), Women's Class (Fri), Parent & Child Class (Sat), Daytime Senior Classes (Mon/Wed), and an Iaido Club (Sun).<br />
        We also offer a newly established special class for students who are currently not attending school.
      </p>

      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">Class Schedule</h2>

      <div class="class-schedule-grid">
        {
          classes.map((c) => (
            <ClassScheduleCard
              title={c.title}
              schedule={c.schedule}
              instructors={c.instructors}
            />
          ))
        }
      </div>

      <p class="detail-page__note">
        ● Special Weapons Class (Short Staff & Nunchaku) — Sunday evenings (
        <a
          href="http://karate15.dokkin.com/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          irregular schedule
        </a>, advance registration required)
      </p>

      <div class="detail-gallery">
        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/hq/Image1.jpg" alt="Junior karate class" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Junior Class</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/hq/Image2.jpg" alt="Parent and child karate class" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Parent & Child Class</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/hq/img6.jpg" alt="Adult karate class" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Adult Class</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/hq/Image3.jpg" alt="Private trial lesson" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Private Trial Lessons Available</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/hq/img5.jpg" alt="Adult karate training" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Adult Class</figcaption>
        </figure>

        <figure>
          <img src="/assets/images/legacy/dojo/hq/4.jpg" alt="Senior daytime class" loading="lazy" />
          <figcaption>Senior Daytime Class</figcaption>
        </figure>
      </div>

      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">History</h2>

      <ContentSlider
        slides={historySlides}
        ratio="4 / 3"
        autoplaySeconds={15}
        lang="en"
        class="content-slider--history"
      />

      <h2 class="detail-page__heading">Access</h2>

      <p>
        <a
          href="https://www.google.com/maps/place/〒003-0021+北海道札幌市白石区栄通２丁目１−２７/@43.0409785,141.3938016,17z/data=!3m1!4b1!4m5!3m4!1s0x5f0b2bb4690b9e5f:0x622b301003410409!8m2!3d43.0409785!4d141.3959903"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener"
        >
          2-1-27 Sakaedori, Shiroishi-ku, Sapporo
        </a><br />
        Dedicated parking available.<br />
        Main Building: 100 tatami • Annex: 60 tatami.<br />
        About 9 minutes on foot (750m) from Shiroishi Subway Station.<br />
        About 18 minutes on foot (1.4km) from Tsukisamu-Chuo Station.<br />
        Approximately 4 minutes on foot from the Chuo Bus stop "Sakaedori 1-chome."
      </p>
      <div class="dojo-list__map-embed">
        <iframe
          src="https://www.google.com/maps?q=43.0409785,141.3938016&z=17&output=embed"
          loading="lazy"
          title="Seishinkan Okubo Headquarters Dojo"
        ></iframe>
      </div>

      <p class="detail-page__note">
        Parking is located behind the annex building at the rear of the property.
        During winter, vehicles are parked more closely together because of snow.<br />

        <a href="/assets/pdf/p.pdf" target="_blank">
          Winter Parking Guide (PDF)
        </a>
        &nbsp; | &nbsp;
        <a href="/assets/pdf/p4-11.pdf" target="_blank">
          April–November Parking Guide (PDF)
        </a>
      </p>

      <p class="detail-page__back">
        <a href="/en/dojo/">← Back to Dojo List</a>
      </p>

    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>